te rescue the H\u00f4tel Hospitalit\u00e9<br></li><li>Enjoy over 30 engaging minigames inspired by Paris<br></li><li>Revisit locations in Unlimited Mode<br></li><li>Unlock achievements as you play<br></li><li>Download exclusive wallpapers and the full soundtrack</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767150/extras/c218da3455df0dcb11aa2c5fd59f5f7e.poster.avif?t=1729486956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767150/extras/c218da3455df0dcb11aa2c5fd59f5f7e.webm?t=1729486956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1767150/extras/c218da3455df0dcb11aa2c5fd59f5f7e.mp4?t=1729486956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join Kate and Nicole and discover the heart and soul of Paris! <br>Bienvenue \u00e0 la Ville de l'Amour!",
